{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born64 is an action-adventure video game inspired by the nostalgic 64-bit era of the '90s. Explore dungeons that breathe history, where every texture, statue, and enemy tells a fragment of a forgotten past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Retro visual style: Graphics inspired by the 64-bit era, featuring textured surfaces, ambient lighting, and fog effects that evoke mystery and nostalgia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Emotional and symbolic narrative: Discover hidden secrets, legends, and symbols that reveal themselves as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Reactive mechanics: Enemies evolve, statues awaken, and the world responds to your presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Memorable bosses: Each boss embodies a myth or emotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Handcrafted design: Every texture, object, and sound has been carefully created to convey atmosphere, narrative weight, and aesthetic coherence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Born64 isn\u2019t just played\u2014it\u2019s felt. A love letter to classic video games, with the soul of a story yet to be told.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1940510?t=1761353830","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940510/a79fcb50b9f534de054086062dd9dbcb3abcb8b2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761353830","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940510/ad679db7df9b6fcc6c4840f0942299e264eef2da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761353830","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940510/ad679db7df9b6fcc6c4840f0942299e264eef2da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761353830","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support",